1127	  /* Reduced motion still needs the transition to RUN, just instantly: the
1128	   * content swap at the end of a collapse and the `onSettled` callback both
1129	   * hang off transitionend, and `transition: none` would starve them —
1130	   * stranding the outgoing content on screen forever. The global block in
1131	   * tokens.css collapses the scale to a non-zero instant for exactly this
1132	   * reason, so no rule is needed here. Same trade the rolling text makes. */
