   * size token — same family, weight, axes and tracking — so they read as the
   * same voice set larger, not as a second one. Keep them in sync by hand if a
   * base role gains a property; they are spelled out rather than composed
   * because BaseText applies exactly one role class per element, so each must
   * stand alone. */
